st powerful card (RedJoker) to beat a single 2 is strategically wasteful. By passing, I allow the Prev Player to win this trick and lead next, which gives me more information about their hand and saves my RedJoker for a critical moment later in the game when it can secure my victory.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
